{"v":4,"catch":"心靈迷宮(Mind Maze) 是一款邏輯競技遊戲，須充分掌握遊戲中的迷宮。","desc":"放置牆面圍堵、建造迷宮、掌握遊戲迷宮的的細節。別讓死角出現，以免被敵人抓住。\n\n計算步數以建立策略，建立邏輯陷阱以攻陷對手。必須機智狡猾，迫使對手犯下錯誤而迅速攻城掠地，您就能旗開得勝。\n\n可進行單人戰役遊戲，或在熱座模式下和其他玩家競爭。","publisher":"Sometimes You","release":"2021-07-29","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","派對","其他"],"players":"單機 1–8 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","荷蘭文","葡萄牙文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":8,"poff":8,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b470a97b72e7a229d4f4cca4782971c814250bf8870d9391225295fa233b7e8f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3ae981c9ba8a0409cc5e488f4dae5b61cfa72d8624cad24f6e05ec1db09fee56.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2cc7f29d75fc2327a71697bcd1016a3c402e19f3cf3370d58dc2827005086215.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/93258d2cf67aa9f9a516a5b8342a2c4e080c2ac231b6a3fc882a9a90ceeb445b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/36d6b2ec50e2a795b390fb1d49f7e28ec16e818abd9172e0322550b422725b37.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/53bf554c63d60b19e3378661d25b481f79b62b12cbe6dc53aff9a79cd6c67249.jpg"],"titleId":"010023601360a000","dlc":[]}